            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Time Left"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "残り時間の数字をタップしても切り替えられます。分表示のときは、残り1分を切ると自動で秒表示になります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "You can also tap the number to switch. In minutes, the display switches to seconds automatically when less than a minute is left."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "毎日": {
      "localizations": {
